1	<!DOCTYPE html>
2	<html lang="en">
3	<head>
4	<meta charset="UTF-8">
5	<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
6	<title>SLM Alliance — sub‑100M</title>
7	<style>
8	@font-face {
9	    font-family: 'Anthropic Mono';
10	FONTLINE
11	    font-weight: normal;
12	    font-style: normal;
13	    font-display: swap;
14	}
15	@font-face {
16	    font-family: 'Anthropic Serif';
17	FONTLINE
18	    font-weight: normal;
19	    font-style: normal;
20	    font-display: swap;
21	}
22	@font-face {
23	    font-family: 'Anthropic Serif';
24	FONTLINE
25	    font-weight: bold;
26	    font-style: normal;
27	    font-display: swap;
28	}
29	
30	*, *::before, *::after { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
31	
32	html {
33	    font-size: 16px;
34	    scroll-behavior: smooth;
35	}
36	
37	body {
38	    font-family: 'Anthropic Mono', monospace;
39	    background: #0d0d14;
40	    color: #e8e6e3;
41	    line-height: 1.6;
42	    min-height: 100vh;
43	}
44	
45	::selection {
46	    background: #a8926a44;
47	    color: #e8e6e3;
48	}
49	
50	/* ── Hero ── */
51	.hero {
52	    min-height: 60vh;
53	    display: flex;
54	    flex-direction: column;
55	    align-items: center;
56	    justify-content: center;
57	    text-align: center;
58	    padding: 3rem 2rem 2rem;
59	    position: relative;
60	    overflow: hidden;
61	}
62	
63	.hero::before {
64	    content: '';
65	    position: absolute;
66	    inset: 0;
67	    background:
68	        radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 60% at 50% 30%, rgba(168,146,106,0.06) 0%, transparent 70%),
69	        radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 50% at 20% 70%, rgba(106,138,138,0.04) 0%, transparent 60%),
70	        radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 50% at 80% 70%, rgba(168,146,106,0.04) 0%, transparent 60%);
71	    pointer-events: none;
72	}
73	
74	.hero-grid {
75	    position: absolute;
76	    inset: 0;
77	    background-image:
78	        linear-gradient(rgba(168,146,106,0.03) 1px, transparent 1px),
79	        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(168,146,106,0.03) 1px, transparent 1px);
80	    background-size: 60px 60px;
81	    pointer-events: none;
82	}
83	
84	.hero-content {
85	    position: relative;
86	    z-index: 1;
87	    max-width: 820px;
88	}
89	
90	.hero-eyebrow {
91	    font-size: 0.75rem;
92	    letter-spacing: 0.3em;
93	    text-transform: uppercase;
94	    color: #a8926a;
95	    margin-bottom: 1rem;
96	}
97	
98	.hero h1 {
99	    font-family: 'Anthropic Serif', serif;
100	    font-weight: bold;
101	    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 6vw, 4rem);
102	    line-height: 1.1;
103	    margin-bottom: 1rem;
104	    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
105	}
106	
107	.hero h1 .highlight { color: #a8926a; }
108	.hero h1 .highlight2 { color: #6a8a8a; }
109	
110	.hero p {
111	    font-size: clamp(0.85rem, 1.8vw, 1.05rem);
112	    color: #9e9ba8;
113	    max-width: 600px;
114	    margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;
115	    line-height: 1.8;
116	}
117	
118	.hero-stats {
119	    display: flex;
120	    gap: 2.5rem;
121	    justify-content: center;
122	    margin-top: 1.5rem;
123	    flex-wrap: wrap;
124	}
125	
126	.stat { text-align: center; }
127	
128	.stat-num {
129	    font-family: 'Anthropic Serif', serif;
130	    font-weight: bold;
131	    font-size: 1.8rem;
132	    color: #e8e6e3;
133	}
134	
135	.stat-label {
136	    font-size: 0.7rem;
137	    color: #6a6a7a;
138	    text-transform: uppercase;
139	    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
140	    margin-top: 0.2rem;
141	}
142	
143	/* ── Section ── */
144	.section {
145	    padding: 4rem 2rem;
146	    max-width: 1100px;
147	    margin: 0 auto;
148	}
149	
150	.section-label {
151	    font-size: 0.7rem;
152	    letter-spacing: 0.25em;
153	    text-transform: uppercase;
154	    color: #a8926a;
155	    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
156	}
157	
158	.section h2 {
159	    font-family: 'Anthropic Serif', serif;
160	    font-weight: bold;
161	    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3.5vw, 2.4rem);
162	    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
163	    line-height: 1.2;
164	}
165	
166	.section-sub {
167	    color: #9e9ba8;
168	    font-size: 0.9rem;
169	    max-width: 550px;
170	    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
171	    line-height: 1.7;
172	}
173	
174	/* ── People Grid ── */
175	.people-section {
176	    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #0d0d14 0%, #11111c 100%);
177	    border-top: 1px solid #1e1e2a;
178	    border-bottom: 1px solid #1e1e2a;
179	}
180	
181	.people-grid {
182	    display: grid;
183	    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(110px, 1fr));
184	    gap: 1rem;
185	    justify-items: center;
186	}
187	
188	.person-card {
189	    display: flex;
190	    flex-direction: column;
191	    align-items: center;
192	    text-align: center;
193	    padding: 0.75rem 0.5rem;
194	    border-radius: 10px;
195	    background: #16161f;
196	    border: 1px solid #1e1e2a;
197	    width: 100%;
198	    max-width: 130px;
199	    transition: border-color 0.3s, transform 0.3s;
200	}
201	
202	.person-card:hover {
203	    border-color: #a8926a44;
204	    transform: translateY(-2px);
205	}
206	
207	.person-avatar {
208	    width: 56px;
209	    height: 56px;
210	    border-radius: 50%;
211	    object-fit: cover;
212	    border: 2px solid #2a2a38;
213	    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
214	}
215	
216	.person-name {
217	    font-size: 0.75rem;
218	    color: #d0ccc4;
219	    line-height: 1.2;
220	    font-family: 'Anthropic Serif', serif;
221	    font-weight: bold;
222	    max-width: 110px;
223	    overflow: hidden;
224	    text-overflow: ellipsis;
225	    white-space: nowrap;
226	}
227	
228	.person-handle {
229	    font-size: 0.6rem;
230	    color: #6a6a7a;
231	    max-width: 110px;
232	    overflow: hidden;
233	    text-overflow: ellipsis;
234	    white-space: nowrap;
235	}
236	
237	/* ── Mission ── */
238	.mission {
239	    text-align: center;
240	    padding: 3rem 2rem;
241	    max-width: 700px;
242	    margin: 0 auto;
243	}
244	
245	.mission blockquote {
246	    font-family: 'Anthropic Serif', serif;
247	    font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2.2vw, 1.4rem);
248	    line-height: 1.5;
249	    color: #d4d0c8;
250	    font-style: italic;
251	    position: relative;
252	    padding: 1.5rem 0;
253	}
254	
255	.mission blockquote::before {
256	    content: '\201C';
257	    font-family: 'Anthropic Serif', serif;
258	    font-size: 3.5rem;
259	    color: #a8926a33;
260	    position: absolute;
261	    top: -0.3rem;
262	    left: -0.3rem;
263	}
264	
265	.mission-goal {
266	    margin-top: 1.5rem;
267	    display: inline-flex;
268	    align-items: center;
269	    gap: 0.6rem;
270	    padding: 0.6rem 1.25rem;
271	    border: 1px solid #a8926a33;
272	    border-radius: 100px;
273	    font-size: 0.8rem;
274	    color: #a8926a;
275	}
276	
277	.mission-goal strong {
278	    font-weight: bold;
279	    font-family: 'Anthropic Serif', serif;
280	    font-size: 1rem;
281	    color: #d4c9a8;
282	}
283	
284	/* ── Footer ── */
285	.footer {
286	    padding: 2.5rem 2rem;
287	    text-align: center;
288	    color: #4a4a5a;
289	    font-size: 0.7rem;
290	}
291	
292	.accent-line {
293	    width: 50px;
294	    height: 2px;
295	    background: #a8926a;
296	    margin: 1rem auto 1.5rem;
297	}
298	
299	/* ── Responsive ── */
300	@media (max-width: 640px) {
301	    .hero h1 { font-size: 1.8rem; }
302	    .hero-stats { gap: 1.5rem; }
303	    .people-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(90px, 1fr)); gap: 0.75rem; }
304	    .person-avatar { width: 44px; height: 44px; }
305	    .section { padding: 2.5rem 1rem; }
306	}
307	</style>
308	</head>
309	<body>
310	
311	<!-- ═══ HERO ═══ -->
312	<section class="hero">
313	    <div class="hero-grid"></div>
314	    <div class="hero-content">
315	        <p class="hero-eyebrow">The SLM Alliance</p>
316	        <h1>
317	            Bigger <span class="highlight2">Isn't</span> Better.<br>
318	            <span class="highlight">Smaller Is Smarter.</span>
319	        </h1>
320	        <p>
321	            Anthropic just dropped <strong>Fable 5</strong> — an estimated <strong>~6 trillion</strong> parameter model.<br>
322	            That scale is not cost-effective. We are proving a different path.
323	        </p>
324	        <div class="hero-stats">
325	            <div class="stat">
326	                <div class="stat-num" style="color:#6a8a8a;">&lt;100M</div>
327	                <div class="stat-label">Our Target</div>
328	            </div>
329	            <div class="stat">
330	                <div class="stat-num">13</div>
331	                <div class="stat-label">Researchers</div>
332	            </div>
333	            <div class="stat">
334	                <div class="stat-num">~6T</div>
335	                <div class="stat-label">Fable 5 Params</div>
336	            </div>
337	        </div>
338	    </div>
339	</section>
340	
341	<!-- ═══ MISSION ═══ -->
342	<div style="border-top:1px solid #1e1e2a; border-bottom:1px solid #1e1e2a; background:linear-gradient(180deg,#0d0d14 0%,#11111c 100%);">
343	<div class="mission">
344	    <blockquote>
345	        Scale alone is not intelligence. We are proving that bigger doesn't mean better.
346	    </blockquote>
347	    <div class="accent-line"></div>
348	    <p style="color:#9e9ba8; font-size:0.85rem; max-width:600px; margin:0 auto 1.25rem; line-height:1.7;">
349	        Fable 5 is estimated at <strong>~6 trillion parameters</strong> — a model so large that running
350	        a single inference costs more than training an entire small model from scratch.
351	        That is not the future of accessible AI. We are building a <strong>sub-100M</strong> model
352	        that beats Gemma 4E4B on every meaningful benchmark, proving that
353	        efficient architecture, quality data, and smart distillation beat raw scale.
354	    </p>
355	    <div class="mission-goal">
356	        <span>Fable 5:</span>
357	        <strong style="color:#6a6a7a;">~6T params</strong>
358	        <span style="color:#6a6a7a;">→</span>
359	        <span style="color:#a8926a;">not cost-effective</span>
360	    </div>
361	    <div class="mission-goal" style="margin-top:0.6rem;">
362	        <span>Our bet:</span>
363	        <strong>&lt;100M params</strong>
364	        <span style="color:#6a6a7a;">→</span>
365	        <strong style="color:#6a8a8a;">beat Gemma 4E4B</strong>
366	    </div>
367	</div>
368	</div>
369	
370	<!-- ═══ PEOPLE ═══ -->
371	<section class="section">
372	    <p class="section-label">The People</p>
373	    <h2>Researchers &amp; Engineers</h2>
374	    <p class="section-sub">Thirteen researchers, engineers, and enthusiasts united under one umbrella to build the future of small language models.</p>
375	    <div class="people-grid">
376	
377	        <div class="person-card">
378	            <span class="person-name">LH-Tech AI</span>
379	            <span class="person-handle">@lh_tech_ai</span>
380	        </div>
381	        <div class="person-card">
382	            <img class="person-avatar" src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Pedro" loading="lazy">
383	            <span class="person-name">Pedro</span>
384	            <span class="person-handle">@pedro.dev.2026</span>
385	        </div>
386	    </div>
387	</section>
388	
389	<!-- ═══ FOOTER ═══ -->
390	<footer class="footer">
391	    <p>The SLM Alliance — building the future of small language models</p>
392	</footer>
393	
394	</body>
